, as well as elements that may not be suitable for people of a certain age. A reasonable restriction of the audience of the game is recommended.<br><br><i><u>Game Features:</u></i><br>- The main genre of the game is &quot;Walking Simulator&quot;;<br>- The gameplay is close to realism.<br>- You will need to study carefully the environment to complete the game<br>- It\u2019s better to read all notes and assignments to understand the plot",
